  <div class="docs-section-body">

    <h2>Patrón: Monolito Rails con Service Layer</h2>
    <p>Capas de arriba a abajo:</p>
    <pre>Controllers / Jobs  →  Service Objects  →  Models  →  PostgreSQL / Redis</pre>

    <div class="mermaid-wrap">
      <div class="mermaid" id="mermaid-arch">
graph TB
  subgraph External["Externo"]
    WA[WhatsApp User]
    META[Meta Cloud API]
    OPENAI[OpenAI API]
