    <div class="docs-section-info">
      <span class="docs-section-title">4 · Flujos Críticos End-to-End</span>
      <span class="docs-section-desc">Inbound processing, cadencia diaria, avance de día, response mode.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="docs-section-meta">
      <span class="docs-section-tag tag-domain">Dominio</span>
    </div>
    <svg class="docs-section-chevron" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
    </svg>
  </summary>
  <div class="docs-section-body">

    <h2>Flujo 1 — Mensaje Entrante (Inbound)</h2>
    <div class="mermaid-wrap">
      <div class="mermaid" id="mermaid-inbound">
sequenceDiagram
    participant WA as WhatsApp User
    participant META as Meta Cloud API
    participant CTRL as WhatsappController
    participant JOB as ProcessIncomingMessageJob
    participant CL as MessageClassifier
    participant AI as OpenAI
    participant DISP as Outbound::Dispatcher
    participant CLIENT as Whatsapp::Client

    WA->>META: envía mensaje
    META->>CTRL: POST /webhooks/whatsapp (X-Hub-Signature-256)
    CTRL->>CTRL: SignatureVerifier.valid?
    Note over CTRL: 401 si firma inválida
    CTRL->>JOB: ProcessIncomingMessageJob.perform_later(payload)
    CTRL-->>META: 200 OK inmediato

    JOB->>JOB: InboundParser.parse → {messages, statuses}
    JOB->>JOB: update Conversation delivered_at / read_at
    JOB->>JOB: Lookup Participant por phone_e164
    alt teléfono desconocido
        JOB->>JOB: UnknownInbound.create!
    else audio
        JOB->>JOB: AudioProcessor: fetch + transcribe + analyze
    else texto
        JOB->>JOB: Conversation.create!(moment: :free_user)
        JOB->>CL: classify(participant)
        alt initial_pattern_answer
            JOB->>JOB: participant.update!(initial_pattern: text)
            JOB->>DISP: send_text ack bienvenida
        else checkin_response
            JOB->>AI: CheckinSummarizer.call
            JOB->>JOB: DailyReport.create!
            JOB->>DISP: send_text ack gracias
        else free_user
            JOB->>AI: FreeResponseGenerator.call
            JOB->>DISP: send_text(body)
        end
        DISP->>CLIENT: send_text / send_template
        CLIENT->>META: POST /messages
        META-->>WA: entrega mensaje
    end
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Flujo 2 — Cadencia Diaria (Morning Wake)</h2>
    <div class="mermaid-wrap">
      <div class="mermaid" id="mermaid-morning">
sequenceDiagram
    participant CRON as sidekiq-cron (hourly)
    participant WAKE as MorningWakeJob
    participant WP as MorningWakeForParticipantJob
    participant AI as OpenAI
    participant DISP as Outbound::Dispatcher
    participant META as Meta Cloud API
    participant IAR as SendIaretoJob

    CRON->>WAKE: perform cada :00 h
    WAKE->>WAKE: Setting.fetch("wake_hour") = 7
    loop cada Participant active
        WAKE->>WAKE: local_time.hour == 7?
        alt sí
            WAKE->>WP: perform_later(participant_id)
        end
    end

    WP->>WP: already_handled? (idempotency)
    alt no enviado hoy
        WP->>AI: MorningMessageGenerator.call
        AI-->>WP: mensaje personalizado
        WP->>DISP: send_template([name, ai_body])
        DISP->>META: POST /messages template
        WP->>IAR: set(wait: iareto_delay_min).perform_later
    end

    Note over IAR: Corre 30 min después
    IAR->>IAR: already_handled?
    IAR->>IAR: in_24h_window?
    alt dentro de ventana
        IAR->>META: send_text(iareto_text)
    else fuera de ventana
        IAR->>META: send_template(iareto_dia_NN)
    end
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Flujo 3 — Response Mode (Human-in-the-Loop)</h2>
    <div class="mermaid-wrap">
      <div class="mermaid" id="mermaid-responsemode">
flowchart TD
    A[IA genera contenido] --> B{ResponseMode.for participant}
    B -->|auto| C[Outbound::Dispatcher.send]
    C --> D[Whatsapp::Client → Meta API]
    D --> E[Conversation.create!]
    B -->|approve| F[PendingResponse.create! status:pending]
    B -->|suggest| F
    B -->|manual| G[PendingResponse con draft vacío]
    F --> H[PendingResponseMailerJob → email admin]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Admin revisa /admin/pending_responses]
    I -->|approve| J[SendApprovedJob]
    J --> D
    I -->|reject| K[status: rejected]
    I -->|edit + send| J
      </div>
    </div>

    <p><strong>Precedencia ResponseMode</strong> (de mayor a menor): <code>participant.response_mode → participant.program.response_mode → Setting.fetch("response_mode") → "auto"</code></p>

    <h2>Flujo 4 — Clasificación de Mensajes</h2>
    <div class="docs-table-wrap">
      <table class="docs-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Condición</th><th>Efecto</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>initial_pattern_answer</code></td>
            <td><code>initial_pattern.blank?</code> + existe <code>Conversation(moment: :welcome)</code></td>
            <td>Set <code>initial_pattern = text</code>, reescribe moment a <code>:welcome</code>, ack "Mañana empieza tu primer día."</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>checkin_response</code></td>
            <td>Hora local en <code>20..23</code> + <code>pending_checkin_at</code> hoy + sin <code>checkin_response</code> previo</td>
            <td>Reescribe a <code>:checkin_response</code>, llama <code>CheckinSummarizer</code>, crea <code>DailyReport</code>.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>free_user</code></td>
            <td>Cualquier otro caso (default)</td>
            <td>Llama <code>FreeResponseGenerator</code>, ack con <code>moment: :free_assistant</code>.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>
</details>

